# Selecting towns by population
#
# Two towns have different populations. An N3 rule uses a numeric
# comparison to classify the town whose population is greater than 1,500.

@prefix math: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/math#> .
@prefix : <https://eyereasoner.github.io/eyepl/examples/filter-town#> .

:town1 :population 1000 .
:town2 :population 2000 .

{
    ?x :population ?p .
    ?p math:greaterThan 1500 .
} => {
    ?x a :largeTown
} .
